WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.504 --> 00:00:10.536
Hello! Welcome to Cosmogeek Solutions. Today we will talk about Custom Software Development.

2
00:00:10.824 --> 00:00:24.504
Every business has processes that make it unique. Generic software forces you to change how you work and charges for features you never use.

3
00:00:24.792 --> 00:00:33.336
With custom software, the software is built around your workflow, not the other way around.

4
00:00:34.032 --> 00:00:38.088
Businesses usually face these problems.

5
00:00:38.376 --> 00:00:45.480
Rigid workflows in ready-made software that do not match how you work.

6
00:00:45.768 --> 00:00:52.272
Recurring licence fees every year for features you do not need.

7
00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:58.416
No way to connect older systems or third-party APIs.

8
00:00:58.704 --> 00:01:03.288
And no full control over your own business data.

9
00:01:03.984 --> 00:01:07.488
Here is what we build.

10
00:01:07.776 --> 00:01:13.608
Fully custom business applications, from design to deployment.

11
00:01:13.896 --> 00:01:20.616
Operational dashboards and admin panels with role-based access and reports.

12
00:01:20.904 --> 00:01:28.920
APIs and integrations such as payment gateways, SMS, WhatsApp and accounting software.

13
00:01:29.208 --> 00:01:36.744
Workflow automation: approvals, alerts and scheduled jobs built into the system.

14
00:01:37.032 --> 00:01:42.888
Upgrading or rebuilding legacy software on modern technology.

15
00:01:43.176 --> 00:01:47.928
And long-term maintenance, improvements and monitoring.

16
00:01:48.624 --> 00:01:57.216
Here is how custom software comes together. First, your business rules are turned into code.

17
00:01:57.504 --> 00:02:06.744
Then separate modules, such as users, orders, inventory and reports, connect through an API.

18
00:02:07.032 --> 00:02:14.736
And finally your team gets a clean dashboard that shows all the work in one place.

19
00:02:15.432 --> 00:02:19.104
Our process runs in five steps.

20
00:02:19.392 --> 00:02:28.104
First, requirement specification: documenting business rules, users and constraints.

21
00:02:28.392 --> 00:02:36.024
Second, architecture: choosing the right technology stack and designing the database.

22
00:02:36.312 --> 00:02:44.136
Third, iterative sprints, with working modules shown to you at every milestone.

23
00:02:44.424 --> 00:02:49.056
Fourth, testing, data migration and go-live.

24
00:02:49.344 --> 00:02:56.280
And fifth, handover with documentation and training, followed by ongoing support.

25
00:02:56.976 --> 00:03:07.584
We use reliable technologies such as Node.js, Python, Java, React.js, PostgreSQL and Docker.

26
00:03:07.872 --> 00:03:15.936
Technology is chosen to fit the project, so the system stays stable for the long term.

27
00:03:16.632 --> 00:03:19.992
Custom software has big advantages.

28
00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:27.264
The software fits your process, exactly the way your team works.

29
00:03:27.552 --> 00:03:33.288
Full ownership. Both the source code and the data are yours.

30
00:03:33.576 --> 00:03:39.336
Connected systems, so the same data never has to be entered twice.

31
00:03:39.624 --> 00:03:44.688
And new modules are easy to add as your business grows.

32
00:03:45.384 --> 00:03:56.496
Internal management systems, field and contractor tracking, approval tools, customer and vendor portals, and replacements for old software.

33
00:03:56.784 --> 00:04:06.984
Custom software delivers the most value in industries like manufacturing, construction, agriculture, distribution and healthcare.

34
00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:18.144
If your business is looking for software that works exactly your way, talk to Cosmogeek Solutions.

35
00:04:18.432 --> 00:04:25.896
Click Start a Project, or call or WhatsApp us. Thank you!
